flowchart LR
  classDef core fill:#365848,color:#fff,stroke:#26302a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef view fill:#fffdf8,color:#26302a,stroke:#8da697,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef guide fill:#f3efe3,color:#4f4631,stroke:#b6a77e,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef growth fill:#e4ece2,color:#365848,stroke:#86a18d,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef guard fill:#f6f6ef,color:#536158,stroke:#c5cec5,stroke-dasharray:5 4

  LC[Learning Commons<br/>content without identity]:::core
  WRITE[Write<br/>quiet capture]:::view
  COMMONS[Commons<br/>shared traces]:::view
  GUIDE[Conversational guide<br/>private guidance]:::guide
  SHELF[Quiet shelf<br/>scan patterns]:::view
  MAP[Idea map<br/>semantic proximity]:::view
  CARD[Loose notes<br/>focused reading]:::view
  TRACE[Content-only trace<br/>observation · method · experiment<br/>decision · idea]:::guard
  MOD[Future moderation<br/>rate limits · public safety]:::guard

  LC --> WRITE
  LC --> COMMONS
  WRITE --> GUIDE
  GUIDE -->|notice → act → change → try next| TRACE
  TRACE --> COMMONS
  COMMONS --> SHELF
  COMMONS --> MAP
  COMMONS --> CARD
  MAP -->|semantic relationships only| TRACE
  TRACE --> MOD

  subgraph GROWTH[Suggested pathways of growth and strength]
    G1[Strength 1<br/>Preserve original words]:::growth
    G2[Strength 2<br/>Make next-reader value visible]:::growth
    G3[Growth 1<br/>Conversational prompts]:::growth
    G4[Growth 2<br/>Semantic clustering]:::growth
    G5[Growth 3<br/>Moderation + metrics]:::growth
    G6[Growth 4<br/>Optional collaborative studies]:::growth
    G1 --> G2 --> G3 --> G4 --> G5 --> G6
  end

  TRACE -. supports .-> G1
  GUIDE -. strengthens .-> G3
  MAP -. enables .-> G4
  MOD -. protects .-> G5

  subgraph PRINCIPLES[Non-negotiable principles]
    P1[People remain anonymous]:::guard
    P2[Ideas are visible]:::guard
    P3[No social graph]:::guard
    P4[Guide is not therapist, judge, editor, or author]:::guard
  end
  PRINCIPLES -. governs .-> LC
